    "detailed_description": "<h1>THE SAINT</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005210/extras/8c9f0b9fee0cc4ce82f801a6c679d138.avif?t=1754506904\" width=614 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>BACK STORY</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005210/extras/BACKSTORY.jpg?t=1754506904\" width=614 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a long day at the office, he left well past midnight. Exhausted and soaked from the rain, he took the forest road \u2014 the one haunted by stories of vanishing travelers and wandering spirits. It was the only way home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The storm worsened as trees loomed like sentinels. Headlights flickered. Roads blurred. Then \u2014 movement. A shadow darted across the path. He swerved. The car skidded, slammed into a tree, and everything went black.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When he woke, the forest was gone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No road. No car.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just endless fog\u2026 a place twisted in silence, pulsing with something ancient and watching. Alone in this shifting void, he begins to run \u2014 not knowing where <i>or what</i> he\u2019s running from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only that it\u2019s getting closer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005210/extras/7455b4bbc4e25382139b7af43837879d.poster.avif?t=1754506904\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005210/extras/7455b4bbc4e25382139b7af43837879d.webm?t=1754506904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005210/extras/7455b4bbc4e25382139b7af43837879d.mp4?t=1754506904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005210/extras/e3ac73cdc27a4a72b79bf53d0303588e.poster.avif?t=1754506904\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005210/extras/e3ac73cdc27a4a72b79bf53d0303588e.webm?t=1754506904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005210/extras/e3ac73cdc27a4a72b79bf53d0303588e.mp4?t=1754506904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005210/extras/e9d762af12ea1462d32e5db4edaca450.avif?t=1754506904\" width=614 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Saint</strong> is a first-person psychological horror experience set deep within liminal spaces \u2014 forgotten halls, shifting corridors, and endless fog, all seen through the grainy lens of VHS body cam visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reality is fragile here.<br>Time loops.<br>Silence whispers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander a dreamlike realm where nothing stays the same, and every shadow might be watching. Solve cryptic puzzles, navigate surreal environments, and hold onto your sanity as the world bends around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the haunting tone of <i>Silent Hill</i>, <strong>The Saint</strong> isn\u2019t just a game \u2014 it\u2019s a descent into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you escape what was never meant to be found? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005210/extras/3f80355edc6e8b9e03c04c1938c6cf2e.poster.avif?t=1754506904\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005210/extras/3f80355edc6e8b9e03c04c1938c6cf2e.webm?t=1754506904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005210/extras/3f80355edc6e8b9e03c04c1938c6cf2e.mp4?t=1754506904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005210/extras/410c49bb26754b09607bb4f5c6b137a5.avif?t=1754506904\" width=614 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f Immersive Psychological Horror</strong><br>Step into a fog-drenched world inspired by <i>Silent Hill 2</i>, where every shadow feels alive and the environment itself breathes with unease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde0 Mind-Bending Terror</strong><br>No cheap jump scares \u2014 only creeping dread, surreal moments, and a constant feeling that something is terribly wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfda\ufe0f Liminal Spaces, Unsettling Silence</strong><br>Wander through forgotten halls, endless corridors, and impossible spaces. You're alone... but never truly alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde9 Cryptic Puzzles &amp; Hidden Truths</strong><br>Each puzzle peels back a layer of mystery. Every step reveals something deeper \u2014 and more disturbing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf2b\ufe0f Unstable Reality</strong><br>The world shifts. Time loops. Sanity slips. Can you trust what you see \u2014 or even yourself?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005210/extras/0d132abe808ec208a7bb14afcab69894.poster.avif?t=1754506904\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005210/extras/0d132abe808ec208a7bb14afcab69894.webm?t=1754506904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005210/extras/0d132abe808ec208a7bb14afcab69894.mp4?t=1754506904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005210/extras/21bce87c8752ed805e32e9007775c21a.poster.avif?t=1754506904\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005210/extras/21bce87c8752ed805e32e9007775c21a.webm?t=1754506904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005210/extras/21bce87c8752ed805e32e9007775c21a.mp4?t=1754506904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005210/extras/ac834f0f530137ddef413563c4cdcb31.poster.avif?t=1754506904\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005210/extras/ac834f0f530137ddef413563c4cdcb31.webm?t=1754506904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005210/extras/ac834f0f530137ddef413563c4cdcb31.mp4?t=1754506904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005210/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1754506904\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005210/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1754506904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005210/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1754506904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
